msgid "How to handle embedded color profiles when opening a file."
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana hendak mengendalikan profil warna terbenam bila membuka fail."

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:56
msgid "Sets the default folder path for all color profile file dialogs."
msgstr ""

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:59
msgid "Use compact style for sliders."
msgstr ""

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:62
msgid "Sets the type of mouse pointers to use."
msgstr "Tetapkan jenis penuding tetikus yang hendak digunakan."

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:65
msgid "Sets the handedness for cursor positioning."
msgstr "Tetapkan ketanganan untuk kedudukan kursor."

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:68
msgid ""
"Context-dependent mouse pointers are helpful.  They are enabled by default.  "
"However, they require overhead that you may want to do without."
msgstr ""
"Penuding tetikus bersandar-konteks memang berguna.  Ia dibenarkan secara "
"lalai. Walau bagaimanapun, ia memerlukan overhed yang mungkin anda ingin "
"lakukan tanpanya."

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:84
msgid "Show full image content by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:87
msgid ""
"When enabled, this will ensure that each pixel of an image gets mapped to a "
"pixel on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Apabila dibenarkan, ini akan memastikan setiap piksel imej dipetakan ke "
"piksel pada skrin."

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:112
msgid ""
"This is the distance in pixels where Guide and Grid snapping activates."
msgstr ""
"Ini merupakan jarak dalam piksel yang mana pelekatan Panduan dan Grid "
"diaktifkan."

#: ../app/config/gimprc-blurbs.h:116
msgid "Snap to guides by default in new image windows."
msgstr ""

